== URL userinfo is scrubbed
### login with userinfo in the URL
$ env GRAIN_TOKEN=<access-code> /home/debian/bin/grain login http://u5er:pa55w0rd@127.0.0.1:4301 --name ui --issue-token --repos acme/allowed --expires 1d
    signed in to http://127.0.0.1:4301 as context ui (external-token)
    -> exit=0
### skill install -dir (ui context)
$ /home/debian/bin/grain --context ui skill install -dir /tmp/grain-skill.wcaLRK/ui-skill -json
    {
      "context": "ui",
      "server": "http://127.0.0.1:4301",
      "version": "v0.0.0-20261108225623-00a5fa1ed98a+dirty (unversioned) · 00a5fa1-dirty · 2026-11-08 22:56Z",
      "deploymentDigest": "5ede479b4561ffb1797010cb1a3e156e18c03ebc920188866f0fea73a02f538b",
      "targets": [
        {
          "agent": "dir",
          "skillPath": "/tmp/grain-skill.wcaLRK/ui-skill/SKILL.md"
        }
      ]
    }
    -> exit=0
